  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（昨日の子は……まぁ、いないよな\r\nちゃんとお礼をしたかったんだが……ん？　あの子──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019001010090,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "──で、この辺曲がったら着くカンジ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900101/1019001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "通行人",
    "text": "ありがとうございます！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019001010100,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "へいへーい、気を付けて～\r\nって、あっ！　見っけた！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900101/1019001010100"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0247",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1019001010110,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "お兄さん、マジ探したんだけど～",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101900101/1019001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0329",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1019001010120,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "ハイ、これ、お兄さんのだよね\r\nなくちゃ困る系っしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900101/1019001010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺の名刺か……ありがとう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019001010130,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "でも、お兄さんなんかすごそーなことやってんじゃん？\r\n『プロデューサー』ってなんかヤバくない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900101/1019001010130"
  },
  {
